From: greeksharifa <greeksharifa@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 19:47:16 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Ignore local Flipped-VQA artifacts

- Exclude dataset links, pretrained weights, checkpoints, and backup snapshots from staging.\n- Ignore Python caches and generated feature-key files while keeping source workflows visible.
---
 .gitignore | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 .gitignore

diff --git a/.gitignore b/.gitignore
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..22a465f
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.gitignore
@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@
+__pycache__/
+*.py[cod]
+
+# Local datasets, pretrained weights, and training outputs.
+/data/
+/pretrained/
+/checkpoint/
+/Flipped-VQA_unchanged/
+/*_features_train_key.json
+/*_features_val_key.json
